# 用量's days slid across by a finger (sfpages usage.mbt usage_chart): MBUI_FIXTURE=settings-usage, a phone's window.
# From today leftwards across the week, let go on a day; from 10/2 rightwards; a date tapped; 30 天, slid across again.
timeout 20000
until $118
wait 1000
dragon -260 0 1800 今天
wait 1000
dragon 260 0 1500 10/2
wait 1000
tap 10/3
wait 1000
tap 30 天
wait 1000
dragon -280 0 2200 今天
wait 1500
exit
